#15903
king troll~
The Troll King~
The Troll King is here!~
So this is the king of the trolls.  He looks extremely intimidating.
He's clad entirely in troll garments.  Upon noticing you, he snorts.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_HUNT|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
80 0 0 300d29+1000 10d7+30
155662 584441
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>fight_prog 70~
cast fireball $r
~
>death_prog 100~
if actorhasobjnum(30900)
or actorhasobjnum(30966)
or actorhasobjnum(30967)
or actorhasobjnum(30968)
or actorhasobjnum(30969)
  if quest(30,1,$n) == 0
    mpmset $n quest 30 1 1
    mpoload 30914
    mpforce $n HELP GUILDTOKEN
    mpquiet on
    c 'giant strength' $n
    give i30914 $n
    mpquiet off
  endif
endif
if quest(0,2,$n) != 1
  tell $n From this day forward, you are an enemy of the trolls!
  mpat $n mpmset $n quest 0 2 1
endif
mpoload 15918
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0,2,$n) == 1
  shout An enemy is in our realm!  Death to $n!
  mpkill $n
endif
~
|
